'''Misa Ono & Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]] and can be obtained in the [[Get On! Kyoto City Subway Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 424
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Misa Ono & Cat
|name2 = Misa Ono & Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Misa Ono & Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This duo of Cat and anime girl unfortunately has no meaning or use in the game other than to boost [[User Rank]]. The best it can do is offer some support in early [[Empire of Cats]] stages like [[Korea (Empire of Cats)|Korea]] or [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Japan]], as it will falter and die at any real threat, like [[Master A.]] Unfortunately, no amount of boost will save it from this fate either, as they have too low base stats.

On the plus side, she has a 100% chance to Weaken [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemies to 50% damage, which may be useful, as you can use her like a suicidal debuffer, unless you have a rapid supply of [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] to protect her, like [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]] or the [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed]] [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cats]]. Even then, it would be better to use and invest in attackers like [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]].

[[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo]] outclasses her in every way, especially with the weaken [[Talents|Talent]] unlocked.

